    "chunk_text": "eac swy\u00f0e georne \u00fe\u00e6t hi ne leng ut of mynstre ne beon \u00feonne heom heora ealdor ge\u00f0afige Ne beon hi binnan mynstre na unnytte, ac o\u00f0\u00f0on on godcundum \u00feenungum o\u00f0\u00feon on o\u00f0rum \u00de\u00e6t is, se \u00f0e nyt beon nelle, he \u00e6niges godes ne abite. Ealde gebro\u00f0ru lufian & l\u00e6ran georne heora gingran, & hyran \u00fea gingran georne heora yldrum. Ne forseon \u00f0a gel\u00e6redan na \u00f0a ungel\u00e6redan, ac l\u00e6ran hi georne, ne \u00f0a \u00e6\u00feelborenan ne lean \u00fea And symble sy swige on beodernne gereorde bro\u00f0ra gehwylces, butan \u00fe\u00e6s r\u00e6deres anes. Gyf hwa agylte, \u00fereage man \u00fe\u00e6ne & steore him georne, & \u00f0a geonglingas swinge man swy\u00f0e. Ne beo \u00e6fre \u00e6nig canonic life \u00fe\u00e6t sundercr\u00e6fta sumne ne cunne, ac began georne mynsterlice cr\u00e6ftas \u00d0us sculon canonicas drohtnian on mynstre gif hi regollican life libban willa\u00f0 & \u00f0\u00e6s wyr\u00f0e beon \u00fe\u00e6s \u00deonne l\u00e6re we \u00fe\u00e6t hy gelome \u00f0as lytlan mynegunga r\u00e6dan & smeagan & on gemynde f\u00e6ste beclysan \u00deonne geearnia\u00f0 hy lof \u00e6t mannum & \u00e6t Gode sylfum ece edlean. A Cristo enim cristiani sunt nominati; Cristus autem caput nostrum est, et nos membra eius. Uerumptamen non se glorietur cristianum qui nomen tantum habet et facta non habet. Cristianus igitur ille est qui Cristum in omnibus imitatur, ut ait apostolus: Qui se dicit in Cristum Et qui se dicit in",
